# Zelkor install (coding agents)

Read [docs/agent-install.md](../docs/agent-install.md) before any platform install or uninstall.

Read [docs/agent-deploy.md](../docs/agent-deploy.md) before `zelkor deploy` or Helm `charts/zelkor-agent`.

Do not use `./install.sh` / `values-local.yaml` on non-kind production clusters. On brownfield clusters with existing Envoy Gateway, use `--topology layered` or `shared`, not greenfield.
